**PHASE 3 — SCALE AND SUSTAIN (2026/27 ACADEMIC YEAR)**

**Phase 3 commitments are tracked in the Action Plan section of the Digital Pedagogy Toolkit HTML and updated each time a JSON file is saved to OneDrive. Key review milestones:**

— 3-month review: July 2026 — Baseline data established. Jisc Discovery Tool deployed. First iTrent session delivered.

— 9-month review: January 2027 — Progress against all 8 KPI areas. Digital Leads in place. AI systematised via COGs.

— 18-month review: October 2027 — Comprehensive evidence portfolio. Recommendation on permanent positioning.

— December 2027 (close-out) — Final evidence portfolio complete. SAR digital dimension contribution. Governance report to VP Quality and HR.

**APPENDIX D — KPI FRAMEWORK SUMMARY**

| **KPI Area** | **Measure** | **Data Source** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Teaching Quality Indicators** | Learning Walk trends; T8 achievement rates | Learning Walk data; TLA profiles |
| **QIP Traction** | QIPs with digital inclusion actions; completion rates | QIP monitoring; HoA reviews |
| **Staff Capability** | Pre/post coaching scores; staff coached; repeat engagement | Coaching records; staff surveys |
| **Staff Confidence** | Self-reported confidence; testimonial themes | Annual staff survey; qualitative feedback |
| **Student Experience** | Learner feedback on engagement, clarity, accessibility | Learner Voice surveys; Apprenticeship surveys |
| **Retention Proxy** | Qualitative feedback on workload reduction; frustration signals | Staff feedback; exit interview themes |
| **Value for Money** | Case studies: time savings, cost-effective alternatives | Documented examples; testimonials |
| **Digital Champions** | Network growth; project completion; peer support activity | Programme records; Teams analytics |

*This document is generated from the Digital Pedagogy Toolkit 2026–27. Last updated April 2026. Data stored in OneDrive under ISO 27001 certified Microsoft 365 tenant. Pilot governance: Quality Team, Weston College Group.*